Package: a4
Title: Explore Batting Styles in the Women's Premier League : ETC5523 Assignment 4
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Vaishnav", "Nayak", , "vnay0004@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides season-level batting summaries for the Women's
    Premier League derived from Cricsheet ball-by-ball data, a function
    that compares batters with the league median and labels their scoring
    style, and a Shiny app that helps franchise analysts identify batters
    who score quickly without wasting balls.
